    "created_at": "2020-06-04T06:23:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-04T06:23:10Z",
    "body": "Ok, we might address a couple of things separately here: \r\n\r\n 1. @mgiuca can confirm if \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded serializer\" is suitable for WST... we hook into one that for now if it's good enough. \r\n 2. \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" itself should be exported properly (or not at all!) from HTML... URL spec exports \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" already, so maybe that should be the canonical one. \r\n 3. We file a different bug to abstract out the forms section. \r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
