    "created_at": "2020-06-04T06:28:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-04T06:28:46Z",
    "body": "My bad ... application/x-www-form-urlencoded serializer is exactly what we need in WST. (Takes a list of (name, value) tuples and turns it into a string.) We should just be calling that.\r\n\r\nI don't think it's appropriate to export application/x-www-form-urlencoded **byte** serializer. That is a low-level implementation detail of the serializer.",
